# CodeAtlas: generated on every index, never committed (rebuilt by hooks, CI and the MCP server)
CodeAtlas/graph/atlas.db*
CodeAtlas/graph/.index.lock
CodeAtlas/graph/shards/*.graph.md
CodeAtlas/graph/manifest.md
CodeAtlas/graph/meta.md
CodeAtlas/graph/unresolved.md
CodeAtlas/graph/clusters.md
CodeAtlas/graph/processes.md
CodeAtlas/reports/*.html
CodeAtlas/*.html
CodeAtlas/graph/.index.log
